      "content": "Thanks for that. It's definitely more professional, but the compliance team is still flagging it for being too \"soft.\" The automated score on that draft is actually pretty low—I think it's only around 3 or 4. \n\nCan you beef up the caution? You don't need to be repetitive, but we need more explicit mentions of the dangers. It needs to feel much more \"heavy\" on the disclosure side to satisfy the higher-level audit requirements. Try to get that metric up a bit more through more detailed descriptions of the various pitfalls.",
